# Test environment — loaded by Vitest automatically.
# Sets the Node.js heap limit for ALL worker processes (forks).
# The jsdom-based policy tests (customer-policy-overrides,
# customer-policy-recommendations, customer-policy-advanced) mount
# CustomerPoliciesPage many times, and some suites can exceed ~6 GB in jsdom.
# Without this, the default V8 heap cap (~2 GB) causes an OOM crash
# in those workers even when the host has adequate free RAM.
NODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=8192
